* hand-written deck, not exported from any drawing
* KNOWN LIMIT (2026-11-04): autoplace assumes ONE positive supply; VEE is
* not drawn as a bottom rail yet, so this deck fails its audits (Q_2).
.title Push-pull output stage
.global VCC VEE
.subckt PushPull in out
.iodir in=input out=output
.name in V_in
.name out V_out
Q1 VCC in out npn
.name Q1 Q_1
Q2 VEE in out pnp
.name Q2 Q_2
RL out 0
.name RL R_L
.ends
